":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MsW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"265bcade-55a3-420d-acaa-f79fd001440c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ヘルプを適当に読んでしまう癖どうにかしなきゃ","ts":"1630656171.351300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y2s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d263df6-c05e-48bf-bb43-404141de32ff","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"いけました! ありがとうございます","ts":"1630656143.350400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46a30d6a-1e73-448f-b661-9ace810c6891","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"一応グローバル辞書なはずですね","ts":"1630656075.348600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h+0"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nskkeleton#config(dict)                                    *skkeleton#config()*\n \n        以下に示すキー(省略可能)から成る辞書を渡すことで設定を変更できます。\n        一部の設定(現時点では辞書関係)は初回起動前に渡す必要があります。\n        また、パスの類は展開されないのでVimの方で展開をお願いします。\n```","ts":"1630655994.347600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"45856341-f2da-4b0b-ab28-ba98e564635b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h skkeleton#config()","ts":"1630655993.347500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RaA"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Installation success: kuuote/denops-skkeleton.vim (fa1992b)","ts":"1630655982.347300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e96ee425-9081-47d9-aec1-a99b7f204af6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":vimhelp plugin add kuuote/denops-skkeleton.vim","ts":"1630655981.347200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Adh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae6a00fa-6008-4a2a-8ceb-2a496eaa2c11","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それでも大丈夫","ts":"1630655974.347000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rfUen"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abb6c3d1-414a-4216-b828-e0e9fbb6094a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```let s:skkleton_config = {}\nlet s:skkleton_config['globalJisyo'] = expand('~/.skk-jisyo')\ncall skkeleton#config(s:skkleton_config)```\n私ならこう書くかも","ts":"1630655948.346600","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1630655967.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hS2Q/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3505355d-2f2c-41f5-98ed-690e91a1fc16","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```skkeleton#config(dict)                                    *skkeleton#config()*\n\n        以下に示すキー(省略可能)から成る辞書を渡すことで設定を変更できます。\n        一部の設定(現時点では辞書関係)は初回起動前に渡す必要があります。\n        また、パスの類は展開されないのでVimの方で展開をお願いします。```\nか\n```globalJisyo                                     *skkeleton-config-globalJisyo*\n        (デフォルト \"/usr/share/skk/SKK-JISYO.L\")\n        グローバル辞書のパス```","ts":"1630655882.345300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Edks0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be193c6b-3f5c-43fc-96a5-08e84b566070","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"```call skkeleton#config({\n\\   'globalJisyo': expand('~/.skk-jisyo'),\n\\ })```\nこう。ちなみにこのファイル本当にグローバル辞書ですか?","ts":"1630655879.345100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ar+IA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f10dd39-9a83-40bb-8859-f6f0cf7a4586","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1630655864.344300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V57tR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c0dd85c-fea1-483e-aa40-84a3a0c5e0d4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`skkeleton#config()` 関数に Dict を渡します。 `globalJisyo` は Dict のキーです","ts":"1630655819.343200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97788735-1684-4b5c-b634-eeb00b5444f6","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まじでちゃんとvimscriptやらなきゃ","ts":"1630655562.342300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5vX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64f3d90e-3016-441f-98b9-91c6a99864c3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"denops-skkeletonで、辞書が読み込めないんですが、設定これであってますかね?\n```let g:globalJisyo = expand('~/.skk-jisyo')```","ts":"1630655541.341700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L7J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b661edb5-e59e-44e9-b01f-506b99da6942","type":"message","user":"U02C54D1XMZ","text":"\u003chttps://aws.amazon.com/jp/premiumsupport/knowledge-center/s3-improve-transfer-sync-command/\u003e","ts":"1630638438.340200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wFUIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"795430b2-e999-4952-8a8b-ab8f6422dfbb","type":"message","user":"U02C54D1XMZ","text":"もうご存知かもしれないですが`aws sync` のパフォーマンスは~/.aws/configのmax_concurrent_requestsの値を変更することで多少良くなるかもしれないです、参考までに","ts":"1630638434.340000","edited":{"user":"U02C54D1XMZ","ts":"1630638454.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F1DO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45e62a89-6392-4b98-80fc-354d20d6a715","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"AWS内のファイル転送なら早いことを期待してます","ts":"1630632754.337600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/7lza"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19ce42e4-1f36-4691-b733-244b297369bf","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"数十万件だと圧縮してアップロードして展開したいですが、多分S3はそんな事できないと思うので、まずEC2に圧縮してアップロード、展開の後s3 syncするとちょっと早いかもしれない。。？","ts":"1630632634.336800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kc9mM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9d9cc7b-df99-4e7c-9e46-9a220f01ceeb","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"愚直にs3 syncしてみたら、案外問題なさそうなくらいのスピードだったのでそれで一旦やってみることにしました\nみなさん、ありがとうございました","ts":"1630632128.335400","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1630632143.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e1dBY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ca262a3-acfe-446b-a1d4-421b86561d1e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"?OS自体にIMEが入っていないということですか?","ts":"1630657624.388800","thread_ts":"1630657256.383900","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"habtW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72b3601e-3adf-40ae-8fe9-88a99b9ed821","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"です。日本語打ちたくなったらおもむろにEmacsを開き、入力してコピーします。","ts":"1630658526.389000","thread_ts":"1630657256.383900","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mNP0b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e767c6a-6667-4f9d-8627-11b8f964eaa1","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"マジか。すごいですねw","ts":"1630658743.389200","thread_ts":"1630657256.383900","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TJbBA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"276cfeab-7758-4d3d-9c9b-33fef11fdc32","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私と同じですね","ts":"1630660376.395200","thread_ts":"1630657256.383900","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"